	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Percepi, vir memorandissime confessionem meam cum tribus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>consensonis vestrę exemplaribus, pro quibus tibi summas <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ago gratias modo in <placeName ref="l24">Termis Marchionis</placeName> decumbens.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Confessionem vel Consensionem vestram Germanice vertere <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nitar; ubi autem imprimatur, ignoro; nam <placeName>Neoburgi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>typographia nulla extat, utpote ab <placeName ref="l875">Hispanis</placeName> dis<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tracta.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>De tractatu in comitiis, quantum religionem attinet, agendo <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>idem iamdudum tecum sensi; sed <placeName ref="l749">Saxones</placeName> et <placeName ref="l1682">Misnenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>evangelium civile amplectuntur voluntque ad <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>politiam referre ignorantes rei naturam id ferre <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>non posse.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Adversariis etiam haud difficile esse ea nobis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>polliceri, quę literis et sigillis ante 15 annos testati <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sunt et nihil nisi bellum praestiterunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Idem in his futurum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>certo prevideo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Quam absurde <placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName>, <placeName ref="l28">Basilienses</placeName> et alii vestrates in <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><placeName ref="l294">Lucarnensium</placeName> et cuiusdam sarctoris causa egisse dicuntur, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>papistis est summę voluptati et quidem non sine causa.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Crede mihi super totius <persName ref="p8375">Anglię</persName> casu eos non tam tripudiare, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ut ad flebilem <placeName ref="l294">Lucarnensium</placeName> casum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Dominus avertat vindictam.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Quis horribiliora cogitarit?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Ego iam ad principem illustrissimum <persName ref="p2411">Otto-Heinrichum Palatinum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>in <placeName ref="l24">Termas Marchionicas</placeName> vocatus sum, ubi nunc eger <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ex altero pede decumbo sperans tamen brevi melius, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>deinde fortassis lavabo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Ex Consensione vestra duos Lutheranos lucratus sum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sunt <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>profecto miseri homines.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Qui damnant non visa, ubi vero <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>vident et audiunt, vincuntur illico veritate, licet rari, nam <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>obstinati <persName>Iehenne</persName> debentur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Princeps meus mittit legatum suum <persName>Adam ab Hohenegkh</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>magistrum aulę, ad inclytum magistratum <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinum</placeName> pro impe<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>trando mutuo aliquot mille aureorum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Quam causam, licet <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>alienior esse et videri possit, quam ut prospere succedat, tamen <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>multis nominibus vellem preces has non omnino repulsam <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>pati.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Res hec mute fieri et agi poterit, ne praeiudicalis sit; <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>proinde de fide data et servanda nihil est, quod quis dubitet.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Princeps <persName ref="p2411">Otto-Heinrichus</persName> habet multas prerogationes et expectati<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ones se brevi ex omnibus debitis suis liberandi; electoratus <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>quotidie ipsum manet, cui adheret <placeName ref="l2477">Palatinatus Rheni</placeName> et <lb xml:id="p1z40"/><placeName ref="l619">Superior Bavaria</placeName> tota.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Quę si etiam non cederent, tamen ordin<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>es nostri ducatus ita sunt comparati, ut ipsi (qui etiam sit <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>vades et fideiussores) certe servent.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quare hoc negotium pro<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>motum esse cuperem.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et aliquid cum hoc viro rescribe.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Ex <placeName ref="l24">Termis Marchionis</placeName> 6. maii anno etc. 55.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8354">G[eorgius] Letus</persName> etc<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Dem ernhafften unnd hoch<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>gelerten herren <persName ref="p495">Henrichen <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullinger</persName>, der kilchen zu <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName> vorgeern<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Antistes.</note> etc. meinem <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>vertraulichen, lieben herren <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>und brudern z handen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
